{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=892970&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-10-13T22:47:20Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"892970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Valheim", "steam_appid": 892970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1620250], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valheim is a collaborative exploration and survival game for 1-10 players set in a procedurally generated world inspired by Norse mythology. Craft powerful weapons, construct elaborate halls, and slay mighty foes to prove yourself to Odin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/798f93b72600a1ddc665fd7b35aaf5ce.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/798f93b72600a1ddc665fd7b35aaf5ce.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an immersive procedurally generated world, with different biomes that each have their distinct environments, unique resources and dangerous enemies. Become a Viking and sail the open seas in search of lands unknown, alone or with up to nine friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/3d44758fd809b08ed1743570d702c731.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/3d44758fd809b08ed1743570d702c731.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tenth World has been corrupted by hateful forces, in the shape of mighty regional bosses known as the Forsaken. Hone your skills with axes, blades and bows, and prepare yourself by crafting the very best equipment – for it is only by defeating these Forsaken that you will advance in your progress and prove yourself to the Allfather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/096525bc9423b2e0f59df23c5acdc3ec.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/096525bc9423b2e0f59df23c5acdc3ec.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise Viking longhouses and build bases that offer reprieve from the dangers ahead. Whether you build a small shelter, an entire village or a mountain-side fortress, defence and structural integrity are important, as is decorating it for maximum comfort!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/b831873c2d698c6efde981d8fdc4d5e1.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/b831873c2d698c6efde981d8fdc4d5e1.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you discover new materials, you will learn new recipes for crafting, building and cooking – all that a Viking might need! The food system is rewarding rather than punishing, granting you boons and benefits depending on what you eat, and is directly tied to the combat system, where your health and stamina might be just the thing that makes a difference between life and death.<br><br><strong>Community-translated languages</strong><br>In addition to the officially supported languages, Valheim has several community-translated languages. As the name would suggest, these are all translated by fans and members of the community, and the process is frequently ongoing. Thus, we cannot guarantee the quality or completeness of any specific translation.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valheim is a collaborative exploration and survival game for 1-10 players set in a procedurally generated world inspired by Norse mythology. Craft powerful weapons, construct elaborate halls, and slay mighty foes to prove yourself to Odin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/798f93b72600a1ddc665fd7b35aaf5ce.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/798f93b72600a1ddc665fd7b35aaf5ce.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an immersive procedurally generated world, with different biomes that each have their distinct environments, unique resources and dangerous enemies. Become a Viking and sail the open seas in search of lands unknown, alone or with up to nine friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/3d44758fd809b08ed1743570d702c731.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/3d44758fd809b08ed1743570d702c731.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tenth World has been corrupted by hateful forces, in the shape of mighty regional bosses known as the Forsaken. Hone your skills with axes, blades and bows, and prepare yourself by crafting the very best equipment – for it is only by defeating these Forsaken that you will advance in your progress and prove yourself to the Allfather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extra